# This is the processing directive for uni-temporal Anchor Modeling in Oracle (Oracle Database 19.7 or later)
#
# The templates are in the Sisula language (docs/SISULA.md) and render the JSON bindings that the
# modeler builds (Generate > JSON bindings). The scripts first in the list prepare the schema that the
# bindings are made from; they run once, before the templates. A line starting with # is not run.
SQL/Helpers.js
SQL/NamingConvention.js
SQL/Oracle/NamingConvention.js
SQL/Oracle/derive.js
SQL/Oracle/CreateSchemas.sisula
SQL/Oracle/uni/CreateKnots.sisula
SQL/Oracle/uni/CreateAnchors.sisula
SQL/Oracle/uni/CreateNexuses.sisula
SQL/Oracle/uni/CreateAttributes.sisula
SQL/Oracle/uni/CreateTies.sisula
SQL/Oracle/uni/CreateAttributeRewinders.sisula
SQL/Oracle/uni/CreateAnchorPerspectives.sisula
SQL/Oracle/uni/CreateNexusPerspectives.sisula
SQL/Oracle/uni/CreateTiePerspectives.sisula
SQL/Oracle/uni/CreateAttributeTriggers.sisula
SQL/Oracle/uni/CreateAnchorTriggers.sisula
SQL/Oracle/uni/CreateNexusTriggers.sisula
SQL/Oracle/uni/CreateTieTriggers.sisula
SQL/Oracle/uni/CreateKeys.sisula
SQL/Oracle/AddDescriptions.sisula
